  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Department of Agriculture: 25 references to U.S. Code sections repealed, omitted or not in the Code (36 CFR)",
      "summary": "In the CFR chapters assigned to the Department of Agriculture in 36 CFR, 25 references in 20 sections cite a U.S. Code section that release point 119-134 of the U.S. Code does not carry in force: 14 cite a repealed section; 9 cite a number the Code does not have; 2 cite a section omitted from the Code. The release names no successor for these sections.",
      "impact": "A reader who follows these references does not reach the text the rule relies on. No effect on a decision or an amount has been established.",
      "correction": "The agency decides whether to remove or replace each reference. The U.S. Code names no successor for these sections."
    }
  },
